sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant E as Cloudflare edge and Access
    participant C as cloudflared in the cluster
    participant D as Dagster webserver
    C->>E: opens outbound connections and keeps them open
    B->>E: asks for a tool's path over HTTPS
    E-->>B: no login cookie, so the login page
    B->>E: one-time code received by e-mail
    E->>C: request sent down an open connection, signed token in a header
    C->>C: checks the token against Access's public keys
    C->>D: forwards the path unchanged over plain HTTP inside the cluster
    D-->>C: response
    C-->>E: response
    E-->>B: response
